  {
    "description": "",
    "index": 86,
    "role": "AXStaticText",
    "title": "",
    "value": "More fundamentally, no library call can guarantee an agent never hallucinates. Weave doesn\u2019t generate or control your model\u2019s outputs. It\u2019s an observability and evaluation platform for tracking, evaluating, and improving agents and LLM applications. It can help you "
