    "title": "",
    "value": "Keep in mind that this scorer is itself an LLM judge, so it can miss hallucinations or flag correct answers. Treat it as a measurement tool. To actually reduce hallucinations, the usual levers are grounding the agent in retrieved sources, letting it say \u201cI don\u2019t know,\u201d and rerunning evals like the one above whenever you change prompts or models."
